      "pillar": "P2",
      "reason": "The Fairway is the scale mission and the campaign document calls it the deliberate spike: an open fairway with nothing to funnel with at all, where they come out of the fog a hundred metres wide. Having nowhere good to stand IS the lesson, which is why the objective is SurviveSeconds and the position cannot be held. Giving it a second front would mean putting a wood across the course and teaching the opposite thing."
